    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41390" root="هوت" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَى هِيتَاءٌ مِنَ اللَّيْلِ</span></b>  <i>A certain time,</i> or <i>portion, of the night passed.</i> Accord. to Aboo-
'Alee, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هيتاء</span> is of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعْلَاءٌ</span>, and quasicoordinate to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِرْدَاحٌ</span>, and belonging to this art.
(TA.)

